{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間 11 月 9 日，Anthropic 發佈 Claude Fable 5.2 與 Claude Mythos 5.2。兩者共用同一個底層模型。Fable 面向所有用户，內置網絡安全與生物安全防護；Mythos 拆掉這些限制，只對通過 Cyber 或 Life Sciences 驗證計劃的機構開放。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585722.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.128655+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:21:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"9a572df33251e01f61eb7f7f8c77429ab188a1ee1d736b68f018cc51d62ba18f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}